    "assembly": [
      "Print both housings and keepers in black and both lenses in white. Original visible light surfaces remain on the white parts.",
      "Seat two M3 nuts in the rear pockets of each black lens seat. Place the white flange against the seat, fit the black keeper, and secure with two M3 x 12 screws and washers from the front.",
      "Seat two M3 nuts in each cartridge plate. Attach each cartridge to the body receiver using two M3 x 12 screws and washers from the rear.",
      "For lens service, remove the cartridge first, remove keeper screws and keeper, and lift the white lens out of its open seat. No glue or snap-fit is required."
    ],
